5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am here. I will try to listen carefully to everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I observe. I will remain calm and rational in my analysis.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Boring. Let's just get this over with. I'm not afraid.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I will protect my friends. No one gets left behind.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will assess the situation. I do not trust anyone yet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know much yet. I will wait for more information.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Premature judgment is dangerous. We need data.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,Data? You sound like a robot. Just talk normally.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Shunichi, be nice. We are all in this together.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am not a robot. I am precise. Precision saves lives.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel a bit anxious. I hope we can find the truth.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Anxiety is natural. Let us focus on the facts.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,Facts are boring. I like a good mystery.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Mystery or not, we need to be careful. Stay safe.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Careful is good. I will keep my distance for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will try my best. I don't want to let anyone down.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I will do the same. Let us proceed with caution.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,Sure. Let's see who blinks first. I'm watching.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I won't blink. I'm ready for whatever comes next.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am ready. I will wait for the night to pass.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
