31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I have a strong feeling about one person. I am very worried.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Worried? Why? What did you see? I am listening.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, look at him. He's sweating. Is he the wolf?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
