35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am observing. I do not trust Daisuke's sudden anxiety.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I cannot say for sure. But I feel a dark presence.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
