38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Vague is good. It keeps people guessing. I like it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Vague is dangerous. We need to know who to trust.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Takumi. Vagueness is a shield for the guilty.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am sorry. I am struggling to speak. Please help me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
