43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Rushing is fun. But I suppose I can wait. For now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will stand by you. We will figure this out together.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will wait. But I will not forget this hesitation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think... I think it is Ryuji. I am so scared.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
